525
00:31:17,092 --> 00:31:19,492
[Durumi Electronics Sales Team Workshop]

526
00:31:22,675 --> 00:31:24,159
There have been reports

527
00:31:24,159 --> 00:31:27,359
of a series of disappearances
in the Habaek area of Gangwon Province.

528
00:31:27,359 --> 00:31:30,269
Starting with the disappearance
of a man in his 50s

529
00:31:30,269 --> 00:31:32,226
hiking Mount Taegong last winter,

530
00:31:32,226 --> 00:31:35,743
a total of seven people
have gone missing so far.

531
00:31:35,743 --> 00:31:37,726
[Mount Taegong, Habaek]
To locate the missing person,

532
00:31:37,726 --> 00:31:39,767
police have decided to deploy
all available personnel

533
00:31:39,767 --> 00:31:41,792
in the suspected disappearance area
for a large-scale search

534
00:31:41,792 --> 00:31:45,726
and stop-and-question operation.

535
00:31:45,726 --> 00:31:49,259
After reviewing all CCTV footage
from around the time of the disappearances,

536
00:31:49,259 --> 00:31:51,384
only the victims
entering the area were captured.

537
00:31:51,384 --> 00:31:54,726
There was no footage
of anyone leaving or anyone suspicious.

538
00:31:54,726 --> 00:31:58,092
That means this was done by people
who know the area well enough

539
00:31:58,092 --> 00:32:00,521
to even know
where the CCTV cameras are located.

540
00:32:00,521 --> 00:32:04,043
Therefore, there's a strong possibility
that their base is nearby.

541
00:32:04,043 --> 00:32:07,259
Considering the area
has many lodging facilities,

542
00:32:07,259 --> 00:32:11,526
