is somewhere around here.

543
00:32:11,526 --> 00:32:13,726
[Taegong Police Station]

544
00:32:13,726 --> 00:32:18,226
Team 1 will thoroughly search
the accommodations and nearby areas.

545
00:32:18,226 --> 00:32:22,035
Team 2 will monitor the outskirts
for any emergencies

546
00:32:22,035 --> 00:32:23,992
